Cell["\<\
Uses the points in the first crystal cell to identify the number of sites and \
split each hopping matrix into site-to-site internal blocks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->343899453,ExpressionUUID->"f188565f-dba3-3649-acdd-5b734dd568f7"],

Cell["\<\
After removing zero matrices, examines only effective displacement keys \
absent from the original nonzero hopping association. It does not search for \
newly enabled bonds within an already present key.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->129694299,ExpressionUUID->"76a0014f-1a07-ff40-a450-f16484fc9d98"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If no new nonzero key is found, returns ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["originalCutoff", "TI",
   FontFamily->"Times",
   FontSlant->"Italic"]], "InlineFormula",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c009afa7-dde4-4541-84a0-182e12aaab68"],
 ". Otherwise returns the maximum site-pair distance identified at those new \
keys."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1253868649,ExpressionUUID->"e07502c8-f39f-5d40-b8ff-8d6472c83199"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The option ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ZeroThreshold\>\""], "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"18f8e365-da27-4e48-b295-4217773f2ec9"],
 " defaults to ",
 Cell[BoxData["1.*^-5"], "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"fb5a4c99-775d-d44d-8f6f-feef168abc0d"],
 " and controls the numerical zero test. Effective matrices must have the \
reduced internal dimension appropriate to the supplied crystal basis."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->164649578,ExpressionUUID->"11ab940e-6d0b-044e-a101-586cbc2f4318"]
}, Closed]],

